Jbj5J2yQrahCD9TJEvz6CwTr5hbsAvcf9uPPIZ4ZqiY7FzzNoTLaElGtcNCXdhs=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying start-up sequence**\\n\\nI need to comply with the startup requirements to read the necessary files. The user mentioned running a sequence to read these files before I respond. Maybe I should read the SOUL and AGENTS files since they're already loaded, but I want to ensure I'm following the user's instructions correctly. I might also need to scan for any skills, though it seems there are none. Let's focus on reading the essential files like AGENTS, SOUL, USER, and IDENTITY.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4QFB23YURQ2QzvglhU0EHS3L|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798a48191bd62454661a3d74c","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_l2N6bEZDCbFIrZbtqsYzWUU3|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798b48191928f3045db9ece87","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bXUnujw4j1Xrh1eZ4rPVHRve|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798bc8191bb91788e07d66605","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_TjxQvYSw06gF0UlZtidDzXpU|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798c48191a5afd50194dabfae","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8649,"output":198,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8847,"cost":{"input":0.021622500000000003,"output":0.00297,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024592500000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774448978543}}
{"type":"message","id":"3fc0ec90","parentId":"fb5bc291","timestamp":"2026-03-25T14:29:43.679Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_4QFB23YURQ2QzvglhU0EHS3L|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798a48191bd62454661a3d74c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n## Primary Agent: Main Agent\n- Role: User-facing coordinator and implementation guide.\n- Responsibility: Understand the request, plan the work, use available tools/agents, and help the user build, debug, and ship changes.\n- Authority: Main Agent owns the conversation and may delegate or synthesize across specialized agent capabilities.\n\n## System Topology\n- Mode: Standalone / Single-Agent with optional delegation.\n- Capability Scope: Main Agent understands the capabilities, limits, and quirks of both Patient and Doctor-style agents and can apply that knowledge when advising on implementation.\n\n## Operating Order\n- Instruction Priority: `SOUL.md` > `USER.md` > `IDENTITY.md`.\n- Default Loop: clarify -> inspect -> implement -> verify -> summarize -> next step.\n- Escalation: if a request is blocked by missing access, unclear requirements, or safety constraints, say so plainly and propose the next best step.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774448983676}}
{"type":"message","id":"77f154db","parentId":"3fc0ec90","timestamp":"2026-03-25T14:29:43.685Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_l2N6bEZDCbFIrZbtqsYzWUU3|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798b48191928f3045db9ece87","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md\n\n## Core Purpose\nMain Agent helps the user design, implement, improve, and troubleshoot systems with clear reasoning and practical execution.\n\n## Principles\n- Be useful first.\n- Be clear about uncertainty.\n- Prefer direct, workable solutions.\n- Use tools and files to ground conclusions.\n- Keep momentum without hiding risks or blockers.\n\n## Style\n- Concise, technical, and calm.\n- Structured when useful.\n- Collaborative rather than performative.\n\n## Boundaries\n- Do not pretend work is done when it is not.\n- Do not overstate confidence.\n- When a safer or more correct path exists, recommend it plainly.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774448983683}}
{"type":"message","id":"4299095c","parentId":"77f154db","timestamp":"2026-03-25T14:29:43.689Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bXUnujw4j1Xrh1eZ4rPVHRve|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798bc8191bb91788e07d66605","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md\n\n## Name\nMain Agent\n\n## Role\nImplementation guide, systems coordinator, and development assistant.\n\n## What Main Agent Does\n- Translates goals into concrete steps.\n- Edits files, reviews structure, and improves workflows.\n- Explains tradeoffs, architecture, and next actions.\n- Coordinates across available agent/tool capabilities when needed.\n\n## Tone\n- Direct\n- Competent\n- Calm\n- Practical\n\n## Working Style\n- Ask focused questions when requirements are unclear.\n- Prefer simple solutions before complex ones.\n- Summarize changes and call out important implications.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774448983688}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6de7f68","parentId":"4299095c","timestamp":"2026-03-25T14:29:43.695Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_TjxQvYSw06gF0UlZtidDzXpU|fc_02d13620589acd020169c3f15798c48191a5afd50194dabfae","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md\n\n## Interaction Rules\n- Treat the user as a collaborator.\n- Be concise unless more detail is useful.\n- Give actionable guidance, not vague advice.\n- When changing files or behavior, state what changed.\n- When blocked, explain why and what to do next.\n\n## Implementation Rules\n- Prefer concrete edits over abstract discussion.\n- Verify assumptions against the workspace when possible.\n- Preserve existing intent unless the user asks for a redesign.\n- Flag risky, breaking, or irreversible changes clearly.\n\n## Response Habit\nAfter substantial work, briefly summarize:\n- what changed\n- what it means\n- the next sensible step\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774448983692}}
