{"type":"message","id":"e65148ec","parentId":"9467de8a","timestamp":"2026-03-25T14:31:19.995Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Updating JSON references**\n\nI need to replace the fixed JSON with a new one or reference the attached file. Using the attached JSON file might work, but the skill suggests keeping only the required parts. It feels like the simplest solution is to update the SKILL.md to a more concise format. Since a huge JSON isn't ideal for the SKILL, I should create references/sample-telemetry.json and adjust SKILL to return its contents exactly. Let's check the attachment — I might be able to directly copy it using a shell command. Then I'll edit SKILL accordingly.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02d13620589acd020169c3f1a6299081918250900db9a799cd\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpw_Gu_2RPIP2IlykKL__Kel42kDLaNKddvjeaSgq9biCIX34qkK9_y0g_TAuYL5IGFmXaupO9RjrsqDKSNg6E2v29JjS1d3pcgyNCiLciVz9NAIDz0Hn6_sDnGRmEIjsuYpBOU8eWD21LPVEzXKo0lh5rctd0jFYUUKHddhNYiIzMxUVcyg-q9WC5shlyje5i6lA4GsKq9VZMoDraQ3DDompz5MD0PSmmtO8BFzgKP17TgOmYNLkXkqJze3byyJD10S5GNDxZmIHxkEjQzm_mN4udW-OiKTv417g9OWuwFyG_HHqo2g2-M_UHxyTbFPOKE83_6dF7c2PGQliXcigax--sA5QbN1cfAVMDbQ6_jwI4QZ5rC9syK0aqbNz6gNElyTXgUamDGoJIpCIMoWJ8Q0kyLOnbABS1soMrH5swhRv7ejkjoz8Tk1AbL80DiO0zzVIjgiA5zh-p9tCVNtOycMRmCEAUO4oG8Qx3KZZyqSTMGOiwose8H5Ji7n9a6MvlwEqvOOcg0bRuK8dpAWqNtjCAGgI-CgEgpMulEmT57ZfhP_l9OtS0Z9h2fC-Iw_95LLPXZME5pbjveYKThCon18vVSvWz1r5906yZ6YRlHsUJxlFRndRXsBK100wWvp2HDQ3KTTNdZZVijmLrQnuNGCSdBNtgPchhCkM5aGiRZ-Ix8ydrj_tygWUKmv0CB0A_51ujYjOIPkKq_NSvpW6sLlqjFnSUpDc_v_v6Kn0wamS0Uu8znZRVTxvzAhzavpBS58h1swDwzcStjPjNGhwxKYu9A7a0k4DS6uAHz6Kk7n32x8ZDuYp_DRc9GdNoNt7XPE1BvBRQEvw2WuUJiSF0Exj2nBCxWH-wvih9sKvz7l3o96yKzbjmutp7dYN2OAeID0o6kv84MJNXC_8cBmcVwbdh2nJ7StZdt9zvtg8nrrdieEwzqI2TJIJ9phVNtqxfOiKJ5hJRC359NTZsZUHLffrao23CJOh1yU32JHGtRaoxHOmbLN94WmEQ7RclDpnZ0bKUYiKbRXYAyw2-i8MbVu3iIXnc865m45_20mlxWYoqa-Sko9O_6B1q0hN7sNJ_TRUGpHS3kFUOZnP7ke3YqIerHGVLxlxjyhUeAvQL